# name: user default
# The integration's default (USB audio, no boot logo) made to fit with the least loss to the sound
# (docs/HANDOFF-fm1.md suggestion: LOFI and VOICE out, the delay at 0.74 s), then the SCRATCH sample set
# (23 KB: the SCRATCH preset; the set can still be uploaded to a USR slot). Every other set and kit, the icons,
# VIEW ALL and FM6's OPL mode stay.
# The boot logo (on by default, 384 B here) stays out: this profile has 44 B of flash left without it (2026-10-06).
ENG_LOFI=0
ENG_FORMANT=0
DLY_LEN=32768
SET_SCRCH=0
SPLASH=0
